  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Your spells have considerable range.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Reach Spell<sup>APG</sup></p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> When you cast a spell augmented with Reach Spell, you can alter a spell with a range of personal, touch, close, medium, or long to increase its range to a higher range category, using the following order: personal, touch, close, medium, long, and 2x long. Spells that go from a range of personal to a range of touch also change from target you to target creature touched, Saving Throw Fort or Will negates (target’s choice) and Spell Resistance yes.</p>\n<p>Alternatively, you may expend a use of mythic power to cast a spell as a Reach spell (gaining only the normal benefits of a Reach spell, rather than the increased benefits outlined above) without preparing it as Reach in advance, taking extra casting time, or increasing the level of spell slot it uses.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/mythic-metamagic-feats#toc33\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
